    <section class="section section--muted"><div class="shell contact-grid"><form class="lead-form" action="/contact.php" method="post" aria-label="Tell me about your project"><div class="lead-form__grid"><label><span>Name <b aria-hidden="true">*</b></span><input name="name" type="text" autocomplete="name" required minlength="2" /></label><label><span>Organisation</span><input name="company" type="text" autocomplete="organization" /></label><label><span>Email <b aria-hidden="true">*</b></span><input name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" required /></label><label><span>Phone</span><input name="phone" type="tel" autocomplete="tel" /></label></div><label><span>Your need <b aria-hidden="true">*</b></span><select name="request_type" required><option value="" selected disabled>Select a topic</option><option>AI training</option><option>Automation / agents</option><option>AI-assisted music / media creation</option><option>Digital project management</option><option>Website</option><option>Digital communication / social media</option><option>Acquisition campaign / analytics</option><option>ERP / business tools configuration</option><option>Collaboration</option><option>Recruitment</option><option>Other</option></select></label><label><span>Indicative budget</span><select name="budget"><option value="" selected>I would rather discuss it</option><option>Under €3,000</option><option>€3,000 — €10,000</option><option>€10,000 — €30,000</option><option>Over €30,000</option></select></label><label><span>A few words about the context <b aria-hidden="true">*</b></span><textarea name="message" rows="5" required minlength="20" aria-describedby="message-hint" placeholder="What you would like to develop, your context, your intention…"></textarea><small id="message-hint">20 characters minimum. A few sentences are enough.</small></label><label class="lead-form__honeypot" aria-hidden="true"><span>Do not fill in this field</span><input name="website" type="text" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off" /></label><p class="lead-form__legal">Fields marked with an asterisk are required. <a href="/en/privacy/">How your data is used.</a></p><button class="button" type="submit">Send my request <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></button></form><div><p class="eyebrow">Direct contact</p><h2>Would you rather talk?</h2><p class="lede">An email, a call or a LinkedIn message: choose what works for you.</p><div class="contact-options"><a class="contact-option" href={'mailto:' + site.email}><span>By email</span><span>{site.email} ↗</span></a><a class="contact-option" href={'tel:' + site.phoneHref}><span>By phone</span><span>{site.phoneDisplay} ↗</span></a><a class="contact-option" href={site.linkedin} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span>On LinkedIn</span><span>Find me there ↗</span></a></div><p class="contact-note">In Nantes or remotely.<br />Your information is used only to reply to you.</p></div></div></section>
